# SurviveAgent Configuration
# ===========================

# No API keys required for basic operation!
# The system uses:
# - CoinGecko free API for crypto prices
# - FXTwitter public API for X/Twitter news
# - DeFi Llama public API for DeFi yields
# - Binance public API for funding rates
# - Claude Code CLI for AI brain (must be installed: npm i -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code)

# Optional: Override default settings
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_BALANCE=1000
# CLAUDE_TIMEOUT_MS=60000
